@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #e8f0fa
  BorderColor #2f6fb5
  ArrowColor #24292f
}
[*] --> COMPILED : one transaction takes\nversion N
COMPILED --> STAGE_5 : rollout stage 1\n(5 percent, bake 5 min)
STAGE_5 --> STAGE_25 : gate passes
STAGE_25 --> CURRENT : gate passes\n(100 percent)
STAGE_5 --> HALTED : gate trips
STAGE_25 --> HALTED : gate trips
HALTED --> [*] : stays in the history
CURRENT --> SUPERSEDED : version N+1 is current
note right of HALTED
  Rollback is NOT an undo.
  Publish the old content as
  a new, higher version.
end note
@enduml
